## Configuration Information Guidelines

- The standard structure for MCP server configurations is as follows:

```json
"{id}_{owner}_{name}": {
    "type": "stdio" | "sse" | "streamable_http",
    "url": "http://localhost:8000/mcp" | "http://localhost:8080/sse",
    "headers": {
