        "ENV_VAR2": "value2"
    },
    "cwd": "/home/silimon/mcp-auto/claude_code/mcp_server/{id}_{owner}_{name}"
}
```

* The `type` can be one of three options: `stdio`, `sse`, or `streamable_http`.
